== Getting Started

1. Install dependencies:
[source,bash]
----
npm install
----

2. Start development server:
[source,bash]
----
npm run dev
----

3. Build for production:
[source,bash]
----
npm run build
----

4. Present

Use `arrow keys` to change slide.
Use `v` to change mode from slide to list.
Use `s` to display speaker mode.
